TaskBackground.description:
TaskBackground counts a task's running background work. Agents and the
commands whose end wakes the agent keep the task running after its turn ends;
watches and other commands do not.

TaskListRestorationStatus.description:
TaskListRestorationStatus carries background runtime/history restoration
state on kind=="status" events. Loading is true until both stages finish;
Error is non-empty when any stage leaves task membership incomplete.
